      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“樱花赏”掀起了风暴般的欢呼声。\n众人无不期待看到下次对决──",
      "source_fingerprint": "578316fe7be78a0ec6f0a522f0e318e914280616e5972ba500176bd9fcb70366",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
