    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8a5503ae79ad80938e061ce",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她发出战帖并获得有资格挑战他人的实力，\n用好战的发言煽动观众，将“樱花赏”\n打造成盛大的舞台。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24d7a6b9ae76e20ff27e5f8858c49ab9bf5353d2d6d87e03a624d0c43f4748b6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a6511905ea940389939b278",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一切准备工作都是为了轰轰烈烈地赢得\n“樱花赏”──为了夺得三后冠时能够耀眼夺目得\n令所有观众留下深刻的记忆。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6dd9c52bed1e2359937c36af5fdc96818046feb3f81642d661902ed74a807a24",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f030d11e6c352fcb2dbb116",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真的有办法就这样轻易放弃吗？",
