      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我完全不打算怀疑她。甚至还觉得\n自己也有责任，都怪我不够可靠，\n不足以让她想到能找我商量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8488b18a1cd18d2bc55cbf75bedc1214c6f1b4aa82180be0dc507b8c96499f5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
